# Playwright test artifacts. These are console/network dumps from live BBO
# sessions against a real account - they can pick up a username, a session id or
# whatever the page happened to be showing. This repo is PUBLIC and must stay
# public (runtime/ is fetched from its raw URLs), so nothing from a live session
# may be committable by accident.
